ackground: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"></span><span title=\"Bleu ciel\" aria-label=\"Bleu ciel\" class=\"h-3.5 w-3.5 border border-gris-bordure\" style=\"background: rgb(195, 216, 234);\"></span></div></div></article><article class=\"group\"><div class=\"relative aspect-[3/4] overflow-hidden bg-gris-clair\"><img src=\"/produits/chemise-popeline-bleu-ciel.jpg\" alt=\"Chemise en popeline \u2014 Bleu ciel\" loading=\"lazy\" class=\"h-full w-full object-cover transition-transform duration-500 group-hover:scale-[1.03]\"></div><div class=\"pt-3\"><div class=\"flex items-start justify-between gap-3\"><h3 class=\"font-sans text-[13px] font-medium text-noir-encre\">Bleu ciel Chemise en popeline</h3><p class=\"shrink-0 font-sans text-[13px]\"><span class=\"text-noir-encre\">99 \u20ac</span></p></div><p class=\"mt-0.5 font-sans text-[12px] font-light text-gris-texte\">Popeline de coton Slim Fit</p><div class=\"mt-2 flex gap-1.5\"><span title=\"Blanc\" aria-label=\"Blanc\" class=\"h-3.5 w-3.5 border border-gris-bordure\" style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"></span><span title=\"Bleu ciel\" aria-label=\"Bleu ciel\" class=\"h-3.5 w-3.5 border border-noir-encre\" style=\"background: rgb(195, 216, 234);\"></span></div></div></article><article class=\"group\"><div class=\"relative aspect-[3/4] overflow-hidden bg-gris-clair\"><img src=\"/produits/chemise-oxford-blanche.jpg\" alt=\"Chemise Oxford col boutonn\u00e9 \u2014 Blanc\" loading=\"lazy\" class=\"h-full w-full object-cover transition-transform duration-500 group-hover:scale-[1.03]\"></div><div class=\"pt-3\"><div class=\"flex items-start justify-between gap-3\"><h3 class=\"font-sans text-[13px] font-medium text-noir-encre\">Blanc Chemise Oxford col boutonn\u00e9</h3><p class=\"shrink-0 font-sans text-[13px]\"><span class=\"text-noir-encre\">109 \u20ac</span></p></div><p class=\"mt-0.5 font-sans text-[12px] font-light text-gris-texte\">Coton Oxford Regular Fit</p></div></article><article class=\"group\"><div class=\"relative aspe