s=\"mt-2 flex gap-1.5\"><span title=\"Blanc\" aria-label=\"Blanc\" class=\"h-3.5 w-3.5 border border-gris-bordure\" style=\"background: rgb(250, 246, 238);\"></span><span title=\"Bleu denim\" aria-label=\"Bleu denim\" class=\"h-3.5 w-3.5 border border-noir-encre\" style=\"background: rgb(124, 147, 171);\"></span></div></div></article><article class=\"group\"><div class=\"relative aspect-[3/4] overflow-hidden bg-gris-clair\"><img src=\"/produits/chemise-smoking-plastron.jpg\" alt=\"Chemise de smoking \u00e0 plastron \u2014 Blanc\" loading=\"lazy\" class=\"h-full w-full object-cover transition-transform duration-500 group-hover:scale-[1.03]\"></div><div class=\"pt-3\"><div class=\"flex items-start justify-between gap-3\"><h3 class=\"font-sans text-[13px] font-medium text-noir-encre\">Blanc Chemise de smoking \u00e0 plastron</h3><p class=\"shrink-0 font-sans text-[13px]\"><span class=\"text-noir-encre\">149 \u20ac</span></p></div><p class=\"mt-0.5 font-sans text-[12px] font-light text-gris-texte\">Coton piqu\u00e9 Slim Fit</p></div></article></div></section><section class=\"border-y border-gris-bordure bg-gris-clair\"><div class=\"mx-auto grid max-w-content gap-8 px-4 py-14 sm:px-8 md:grid-cols-3\"><div><h3 class=\"font-serif text-[21px] text-noir-encre\">Sans interm\u00e9diaire</h3><p class=\"mt-2 font-sans text-[13.5px] font-light leading-relaxed text-gris-texte\">Nous vendons uniquement en direct, dans nos boutiques et ici. Pas de grossiste, donc pas de marge en cascade.</p></div><div><h3 class=\"font-serif text-[21px] text-noir-encre\">Pi\u00e8ces s\u00e9parables</h3><p class=\"mt-2 font-sans text-[13.5px] font-light leading-relaxed text-gris-texte\">Veste et pantalon se commandent dans deux tailles diff\u00e9rentes. Le costume tombe juste sans retouche.</p></div><div><h3 class=\"font-serif text-[21px] text-noir-encre\">Retours offerts</h3><p class=\"mt-2 font-sans text-[13.5px] font-light leading-relaxed text-gris-texte\">Trente jours pour essayer chez vous. Livraison et retour \u00e0 notre charge, en France comme en Europe.</p></div></div></section><section class=\"mx-auto max-w-content px-4 py-20 text-center sm:px-8\"><p class=\"eyebrow\">Conseiller de style</p><h2 class=\"mx-auto mt-3 max-w-[640px] font-serif text-[34px] leading-[1.15] sm:text-[42px]\">Vous ne savez pas par o\u00f9 commencer&nbsp;?</h2><p class=\"mx-auto mt-5 max-w-[560px] font-sans text-[15px] font-light leading-[1.75] text-gris-texte\">Dites-nous l\u2019occasion, la mati\u00e8re et le budget. Nous composons la tenue, et vous l\u2019essayez sur votre propre photo avant de commander.</p><button type=\"button\" class=\"btn-dark mt-8 px-9 py-4\">Composer ma tenue</button></section></main><footer class=\"border-t border-gris-bordure bg-blanc-pur\"><div class=\"mx-auto max-w-content px-4 py-16 sm:px-8\"><div class=\"grid gap-10 md:grid-cols-4\"><div><span class=\"select-none whitespace-nowrap font-serif font-medium leading-none text-[26px] tracking-[0.18em] text-noir-encre\">ANDR\u00c9 LAURENT</span><p class=\"mt-4 max-w-[260px] font-sans text-[12.5px] font-light leading-relaxed text-gris-texte\">Pr\u00eat-\u00e0-porter masculin dessin\u00e9 \u00e0 Paris, fabriqu\u00e9 en Europe et vendu en direct.</p><a href=\"/\" aria-label=\"Instagram\" class=\"mt-5 inline-flex text-noir-encre transition-opacity hover:opacity-60\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"currentColor\" class=\"h-5 w-5\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M12 2.163c3.204 0 3.584.012 4.85.07 3.252.148 4.771 1.691 4.919 4.919.058 1.265.069 1.645.069 4.849 0 3.205-.012 3.584-.069 4.849-.149 3.225-1.664 4.771-4.919 4.919-1.266.058-1.644.07-4.85.07-3.204 0-3.584-.012-4.849-.07-3.26-.149-4.771-1.699-4.919-4.92-.058-1.265-.07-1.644-.07-4.849 0-3.204.013-3.583.07-4.849.149-3.227 1.664-4.771 4.919-4.919 1.266-.057 1.645-.069 4.849-.069zM12 0C8.741 0 8.333.014 7.053.072 2.695.272.273 2.69.073 7.052.014 8.333 0 8.741 0 12c0 3.259.014 3.668.072 4.948.2 4.358 2.618 6.78 6.98 6.98C8.333 23.986 8.741 24 12 24c3.259 